# CORTEX VIDEO: scenes launched on the beat and morphed (LAUNCH, MORPH), chained by the bar (CHAIN), and a matrix key
# that learns a knob (held, a knob turned: a Jump there, put back when let go). The tempo: 120 (a beat 500 ms)
wait 60
press SEL
key 0 down
key 0 up
release SEL
spin K1 2
spin K3 20
expect par0 7
expect par2 100
press SEL
key 1 down
key 1 up
release SEL
expect scenes 3
turn SELECT 28
expect page 28
spin K2 1
spin K3 2
key 0 down
key 0 up
expect par0 7
wait 600
expect par0 5
wait 2000
expect par2 60
expect scene 0
spin K4 1
wait 2300
expect scene 1
spin K4 -1
turn SELECT -28
expect page 0
key 16 down
spin K2 3
expect par1 3
key 16 up
expect par1 0
key 16 down
expect par1 3
key 16 up
expect par1 0
shot scenes.png
